WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.780 --> 00:00:04.340
Do you know why
you were arrested?

00:00:04.340 --> 00:00:07.300
Do you ever feel the hair on
the back of your neck stand up?

00:00:07.300 --> 00:00:11.680
That's your intuition, and
you should listen to it.

00:00:11.680 --> 00:00:14.080
I was in the FBI for 25 years.

00:00:14.080 --> 00:00:17.470
I developed an investigative
tool called criminal profiling.

00:00:17.470 --> 00:00:20.380
And I'm going to teach you
some of the tactics I've used

00:00:20.380 --> 00:00:24.880
from the people I interviewed.

00:00:24.880 --> 00:00:26.530
What is their motive?

00:00:26.530 --> 00:00:28.960
And what is their behavior?

00:00:28.960 --> 00:00:31.760
I had gone there for the
same purposes as before .. .

00:00:31.760 --> 00:00:34.330
to kill girls.

00:00:34.330 --> 00:00:36.330
You'll be learning how
to spot these character

00:00:36.330 --> 00:00:37.440
traits in others.

00:00:40.210 --> 00:00:43.770
The skills taught in this class
could very well save your life.

00:00:43.770 --> 00:00:48.380
I'm John Douglas, and
this is MasterClass.

